Files in lnn/ derived from that repository, and how they were modified:
  train.py           train_from_scratch() takes an explicit validation_data_path; physical masses are passed to the
                     model (enforce_mass_matrix/masses arguments).
  dataset_creation.py  trajectory tests accept explicit initial states (test_states); normalize_training_data has an
                     optional time-scaling mode. The paper's runs used normalize=False.
  file_exports.py, analytical_tools.py   comments only / one argument-list formatting change.
  variance_preserving_initializations.py  last-layer gain configurable (not used by the paper's runs).
  ode_solve.py       unmodified.
  physical_systems.py  trimmed to the two systems of this work; the classes three_body (Lennard-Jones +
                     Axilrod-Teller) and newt_three_body (Newtonian gravity) were written for this work.
Files written for this work: lnn/fixedkinetic_LNN.py (fixed-kinetic Lagrangian network with geometric features),
lnn/release_io.py, data_generation/, scripts/, notebooks/.
